            <div xml:id="d290">

                <pb facs="0327" n="245" xml:id="pg245"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 862.413St4/24.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the American
                        Ambassador.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1911-05-31"><hi rendition="#italic">May 31,
                        1911</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Ascertain whether the appointment of C. P. Wolfram in addition to Bartholdt as
                    the President’s representative is agreeable to the German Emperor.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hale.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
